      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a terrible feeling to feel like your entire life's work was a mistake, but the math of your pain is real and the pain is real. The point of trying to start over is not to fix the past, but to stop the bleeding and find a way to survive the present. You are not bankrupt; you are just in a very deep hole right now, and the only way out is to stop trying to climb and start learning how to dig.",
