      "content": "digging? that just sounds like more work. more exhaustion. why do i have to keep digging when there's nothing at the bottom? it's like you're telling me to keep investing energy into a project that's already failed. once you realize a project is a total loss, you usually just cut your losses and walk away. it's the only logical thing to do so you don't lose even more. why is it different with a life?",
